OL,3,GNEWSAWhat Birmingham thinks about its
OL,4,Abusking ban as fine hike considered
OL,5,
OL,6,FBusker David Fisher went into
OL,7,FBirmingham city centre this week to
OL,8,Fplay his guitar and sing in what was
OL,9,Fpreviously a prime busking spot - right
OL,10,Fon the high street.
OL,12,FBy doing so, he was knowingly breaching
OL,13,Fa Public Spaces Protection Order (PSPO)
OL,14,Fimplemented by Birmingham City Council
OL,15,Fa year ago, which bans people from
OL,16,Fusing musical instruments or
OL,17,Famplification equipment on certain
OL,18,Fstreets in the city centre.
OL,20,FWhile it also affects street preachers
OL,21,Fand public speakers, it has had a
OL,22,Fmassive impact on buskers in the city.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
