OL,3,GNEWSAWhat Birmingham thinks about its
OL,4,Abusking ban as fine hike considered
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor the past year, breaching the PSPO
OL,7,Fwould land people with a #100 fine, but
OL,8,Fthe council is now considering whether
OL,9,Fto raise this to #500.
